			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 18, DX 13, IQ 3, HT 11, HP 18, WILL 8, PER 9, FP 11, SPEED 6, MOVE 3, DODGE 9, DR 3. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "n1yUNlWamn4TuWF0F",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 19 (offense 7, protection 12), threat tier minor, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "nR9nLitYO48_DMWqd",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/giant-sea-horse.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nAXYP0dyZCH2QQzsx",
			"text": "Independent build total: -39 points of racial traits plus 1 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "na1Kupg2MGBk5at7b",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Sea Horse (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "nr9NJemqvI9wtNGSc",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nITJ60nCBKe5C1Zc6",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 180 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nYZ4tq901_2746clQ",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 3; water Move 3 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nR5jfOWWTpOs_KZAz",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "n45dev0GR0aossBAY",
			"text": "Three metres from crown to curled tail, which is the SM +1 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZKTp8ylZSZcLPNwl",
			"text": "ST is set by what a mount has to do: Basic Lift must carry an armed rider. That raised it from an earlier draft, where it had been scaled from mass and could not have borne one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nbhU9Q-LINihGD-hE",
			"text": "Deliberately slow: Basic Move is bought down, because a sea horse's whole body plan trades speed for armour and station-keeping."
		},
		{
			"id": "nnRmHNIfn9kFC2_hK",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "nhreye6rpMFiuiw7W",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
